          "kicker": "WXV Global Series",
          "heading": "Scotland Women suffer heavy defeat as New Zealand run in ten tries",
          "body": "Scotland Women struggled to contain a clinical New Zealand side, falling to a 66-14 defeat at Hive Stadium on Friday. Despite two first-half tries from Evie Gallagher, the visitors’ pace proved too much for the Scottish defence. New Zealand dominated the encounter with 10 tries, effectively ending the match as a contest before half-time. Scotland now turn their attention to a meeting with Australia at the same venue this Saturday, looking to bounce back from successive tournament losses."
        },
