          "heading": "Argentina reflects on recent performance following draw against Australia side",
          "body": "Argentina enters the latest international window seeking consistency after a challenging run of results. Across their last five matches, Los Pumas have recorded 1 win, 3 losses, and 1 draw. The team’s most recent outing saw them draw 28-28 with Australia in September. Having finished on the wrong side of a 31-24 scoreline against England in their previous fixture, the squad will look to address their form as they prepare for the upcoming November programme."
