        {
          "kicker": "Selection News",
          "heading": "Jordan Petaia returns to Wallabies squad after brief NFL football stint",
          "body": "Jordan Petaia has rejoined the Wallabies squad for this week's one-off Test against South Africa. The utility back, who recently joined the Urayasu D-Rocks, previously left Australian rugby to pursue an NFL career with the Los Angeles Chargers. Petaia revealed his American football tenure was cut short due to a misdiagnosed hamstring injury that required a period of rehabilitation. Head coach Les Kiss has included the 26-year-old in a 34-man group as Australia look to continue their current momentum."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Japan defeat Fiji to secure Pacific Nations Cup title",
